Rule 7 (input tensor x must have positive dimensions if its dimension is greater than zero)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 8 (the number of dimensions of x should be at most 8)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≤ 8
